---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About ManhwaDaily — How We Pick and Check Manhwa"
  description="ManhwaDaily is an independent manhwa guide: rankings, where-to-read guides and tools. Here is how we pick titles, check facts and make money."
  slug="about"
>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="border-b border-brand-border/50 py-14">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
        <p class="text-brand-coral text-sm font-semibold mb-3">ManhwaDaily</p>
        <h1 class="font-display font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-brand-white mb-4">
          About ManhwaDaily
        </h1>
        <p class="text-brand-dim leading-relaxed">
          An independent guide for people who read Korean webcomics — what to read next,
          and where to read it legally.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
        <h2>What we publish</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Rankings and recommendation lists</strong> by genre, trope and mood.</li>
          <li><strong>Where-to-read guides</strong> that point to official platforms such as
            WEBTOON, Tapas, Manta and Tappytoon. Our most-read guide is
            <a href="/best-sites-read-manhwa-online-free-2026/">Best Sites to Read Manhwa Online Free</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Tools:</strong> the <a href="/recommender/">recommendation quiz</a>,
            <a href="/manhwa-dna/">Manhwa DNA</a>, the <a href="/tier-list/">tier list maker</a>
            and <a href="/discover/">Discover</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Extras:</strong> a free browser game, <a href="/gate-crawler-world/">Gate Crawler World</a>,
            and the paid <a href="/portrait/">AI Portrait</a> feature.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How we pick and check titles</h2>
        <p>
          Recommending a series that does not exist is the worst mistake a guide like this can
          make, so every title we list is checked against public databases (MangaDex metadata
          and AniList) to confirm it is a real, published series. Posts are drafted with AI
          assistance and then go through an automated fact-check and editorial review before
          they are published; drafts that fail are rewritten or dropped.
        </p>
        <p>
          Ratings and rankings are our editorial opinion, not objective scores. When we get
          something wrong — a title, a status, a broken link — we fix it. Tell us through the
          <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Reading legally</h2>
        <p>
          ManhwaDaily does not host chapters or scans. We link to official platforms wherever an
          official English release exists, so creators get paid. Cover images appear only to
          identify the series being discussed.
        </p>

        <h2>How the site makes money</h2>
        <p>
          ManhwaDaily is free to read. It is funded by affiliate links (as an Amazon Associate we
          earn from qualifying purchases, at no extra cost to you), by the optional paid AI
          Portrait feature, and it may display advertising. Affiliate relationships never decide
          which series we recommend. Details are in our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>
          and <a href="/terms/">Terms</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Corrections, broken links, copyright requests or partnership questions:
          see the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Base>
